<!-- About -->
<section id="about" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 mb-3">About Me</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl mb-6">From graduate to developer</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        I'm Zwivhuya Mathada, a Full-Stack Developer from Thohoyandou, Limpopo. I recently completed my Diploma in ICT Application Development at Cape Peninsula University of Technology (CPUT) and have already gained real industry experience as a Software Developer at Code7Solutions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        At Code7, I built and deployed web and mobile applications for real clients, developed APIs, and implemented secure database systems with JWT authentication — shipping production code used by actual users.
      </p>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        I'm now looking for a junior or graduate developer role where I can keep growing, contribute to a strong team, and build things that matter.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- Certifications -->
